<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Thakral half year net profit doubles.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Thakral half year net profit doubles.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    13.87 vs 6.78</p>
<p>    Net				     13.82 vs 6.78</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     2.50 vs 2.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Thakral Holdings Ltd is a hotel and retail centre operator and owner and the company is controlled by Thakral Group of Singapore.</p>
<p>    Sales				  102.35 vs 86.83</p>
<p>    Other income			   0.56 vs 1.76</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    3.07 vs 1.91</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 14 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date Mar 20</p>
<p>Reg date Feb 28</p>
<p>    Tax					0.05 vs nil</p>
<p>    Interest				 9.38 vs 11.10</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   2.08 vs 1.31</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
